From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Luca Martinetti <luca@luca.io>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 08:51:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] Keep the previous recap visible and add a current-goal
 line

Upstream hides the recap while regenerating and only ever shows one line,
so while a run is active there is no sign of what the agent is doing.
Keep the previous step's Recap visible, and add a Goal line derived from
the current prompt until the run settles.
---
